---
description: Cloudflare deployment and security rules
globs: ["src/**/*.astro", "scripts/**", "public/_headers"]
---

## Rocket Loader Constraints
- All `<script is:inline>` MUST have `data-cfasync="false"`
- No inline `onclick`/`onchange`/`onsubmit`/`onX` handlers — use `addEventListener`
- Module scripts (`<script>` without is:inline) compile to `type="module"` and may not execute on first load with View Transitions
- For critical DOM scripts, use `is:inline data-cfasync="false"` with `addEventListener`
- Use `astro:page-load` event for DOM re-initialization after navigation

## CSP Dual-Layer (CRITICAL — must stay synced)
Two places define Content Security Policy:
1. `scripts/generate-headers.ts` → generates `public/_headers`
2. `src/layouts/BaseLayout.astro` → `<meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy">`

Both MUST contain identical directives. To add a new domain:
1. Update `generate-headers.ts`
2. Update `BaseLayout.astro`
3. Verify: `bun run build && grep "new-domain" dist/_headers`

## Current CSP
- `script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' challenges.cloudflare.com static.cloudflareinsights.com`
- `style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'`
- `connect-src 'self' <supabase-url> cloudflareinsights.com`
- `frame-src challenges.cloudflare.com`
- Never add `unsafe-eval`

## Security Headers (all in public/_headers)
- X-Frame-Options: DENY
- X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
- Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
- HSTS: max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains; preload
- Permissions-Policy: camera=(), geolocation=(), microphone=()
